{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19045","headline":"詶马大夫以愚献通草茇葜酒感通拔二字因而寄别之作 · 刘禹锡","name":"詶马大夫以愚献通草茇葜酒感通拔二字因而寄别之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"泥沙难振拔，谁复问穷通。\n莫讶提壶赠，家传枕麴风。\n成谣独酌後，深意片言中。\n不进终无已，应须荀令公。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19045.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19045","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}